Filetype: IR signals file
Version: 1
#
# MELPO BLFL-LFBA RGBW floodlight, 50 W, ASIN B08T5XR951, F2-family remote.
# Reconstructed NEC commands physically tested using a Cardputer ADV.
# Original remote unavailable; not direct captures. Flipper hardware untested.
# Power and brightness verified. Scene names matched to F2 manual and behavior.
# Red/Yellow/Green/Blue are fine wheel adjustments; repeat taps as needed.
# Store_1 and Store_2 recall editable colors, not fixed color buttons.
# DIY_FLASH short-press effect tested; long-press programming untested.
# Source and confidence: https://github.com/wmichelin/melpo-f2-ir
# License: CC0-1.0
#
name: Power_on
type: parsed
protocol: NEC
address: 00 00 00 00
command: 47 00 00 00
#
name: Power_off
type: parsed
protocol: NEC
address: 00 00 00 00
command: 43 00 00 00
